<description>&lt;p&gt;Lebanese army seized 264 kg of explosives smuggled from Syria and Syrian authorities seized a weapons shipment bound for Lebanon, indicating ongoing cross-border illicit trade. Syrian forces destroyed 400 million captagon pills in raids and a Syrian soldier was killed with two injured during a mine-clearing operation in Deir ez-Zor. Russian strikes killed three children in Aleppo, while Turkish accusations link Israel to arming Druze fighters in southern Syria. The United Nations recognized Syria's anti-drug and anti-crime efforts, and 2,732 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;L'Orient Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxONmFkaU52U183ZW0xcEpkUHhNa3VvMFNyZWE4UmhXM2R2cnNxVEk1SDc2OGxmTTFyWUtCS0xZNTRHbEtKblVpN0tyNzl5eEVzOWZuX0hhNlUxMXdkS2tMc0x4bWRpVVk5UXFGSUpwMUotb0NZWjdJSVJlSmVBbXFXeDVLa3lUcWZzUnExclZfNjVRSEQxSjRYdDE2Y0VJWFo4NVpnNzR2eFNDZWNNRnRBS1N1el8?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPNDB3alY0Z1FvTG1SV0M4T19LVmZ4bWZ2Yk1sMWZRd1prR09kTXVMOFk1aEllSTMxNVQ5UU41dzBiZU1nTmhMMTBrOEtJSm5Nb2cybzM1WE5ZVUxLT3J3M2RjYXgyQVYtNTlMQU1RQ0FPTGFKQjYyVGNhTVNLdTFGSUx5Wm55R1AyMnpiRDFnNmdYczJYdDhKTXd5VlpRcW9KMk9tSTRHSUxya2wxbG54Z092OFA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5XZkV0YTNkZU10d3hUR0VpSThuU1lUNXZ5d0RBWVNjZlR6U3plOWR0STJWOTV5dmZVV3FRUG1XMVNMakI2U1JNRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;سانا&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxOTmNhZ19UZXlNRF9Ya2lvYl9ueFByZ0F5TXptdHNja1Jpd3FNU1dkU01MMlJETmd2bE5ocHlEY0Z4ZW5jSXNkRVplczhtM0VvMnRDZ2M3dkl5VmtfTVRJbEJLc3pMdGxzbC1qX0lZMlpPSW